      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DUKE.\nO place and greatness, millions of false eyes\nAre stuck upon thee; volumes of report\nRun with these false, and most contrarious quest\nUpon thy doings; thousand escapes of wit\nMake thee the father of their idle dream\nAnd rack thee in their fancies.",
