      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DUKE.\nNor, gentle daughter, fear you not at all.\nHe is your husband on a pre-contract.\nTo bring you thus together ’tis no sin,\nSith that the justice of your title to him\nDoth flourish the deceit. Come, let us go;\nOur corn’s to reap, for yet our tithe’s to sow.",
